{
  "uid": "pulsar-capture",
  "title": "Pulsar.ml — Capture health",
  "description": "Completeness of the non-blocking capture: written, spooled, replayed and dropped rows, errors, storage availability",
  "tags": [
    "pulsar.ml"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "bucket",
        "label": "Bucket",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "monitoring",
        "current": {
          "text": "monitoring",
          "value": "monitoring"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "influxdb",
          "uid": "pulsar-influx"
        },
        "query": "import \"influxdata/influxdb/schema\"\nschema.tagValues(bucket: \"${bucket}\", tag: \"model_id\", predicate: (r) => r._measurement == \"pulsar_results\", start: -30d) |> filter(fn: (r) => r._value != \"permit_assistant\")",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "text": "admissibilite",
          "value": "admissibilite"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "version",
        "label": "Version",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "influxdb",
          "uid": "pulsar-influx"
        },
        "query": "import \"influxdata/influxdb/schema\"\nschema.tagValues(bucket: \"${bucket}\", tag: \"model_version\", predicate: (r) => r._measurement == \"pulsar_results\" and r.model_id == \"${model}\", start: -30d)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "text": "1.0",
          "value": "1.0"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The capture never slows down predictions: rows are queued and written by a background thread. When the database is unavailable they are **spooled** to disk and replayed; only without a spool directory, or when the queue is full, are they **dropped** and counted."
      },
      "datasource": null,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      }
    },
